{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Label:","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":" svc_sql has an SPN and a password found in rockyou.txt. Cracking its ticket gave a foothold that led to Domain Admin."}]}
